<title>USA: Ford July U.S. vehicle sales rise 5.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Ford July U.S. vehicle sales rise 5.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   153,407	   162,110	     -5.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 200,342	   174,377	    +14.9</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	  353,749	   336,487	     +5.1</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jul 31, 1997 Jan 1-Jul 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   986,913	 1,071,379	     -7.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck     1,317,117	 1,248,164	     +6.1</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	2,304,030	 2,319,543	     -0.1</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, and for year to date 179 vs 180.</p>
</text>
